import LatticeProb.Prob.HoeffdingSeries.Tail

/-!
# Hoeffding's inequality for an infinite independent series

For measurable independent centered real variables bounded by one and square-summable real
weights, `LatticeProb.hoeffding_series` gives a canonical almost sure and `L²` limit and its
Hoeffding tail bound. The separate zero square-sum theorem identifies the degenerate limit.
-/
